 slim build, but she has cute round cheeks. She has an A cup bust. Yize is very fit and has strong arms because he is a fighter, but is not crazy muscular (see references). You can draw him topless but please keep his bandaid around his abdomen.\n\nI really liked how you drew the couple's expression sweetly in this work and would like for a similar vibe~ https://skeb.jp/@hayulf8/works/215\n\nIf it's not comfortable to draw please cancel directly, if you need to adjust the pricing please do so as well. Thank you teacher for considering my request! (✿◡‿◡)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JaktwgXKQVUfSn9qhU7DQBTF1JiA6wYJ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}